'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[heavy armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

==Acquisition==
Both the [[body armor]] and [[helmet]] can be claimed from page one of the [[Dust Devils Premium Warbond#Page 1|Dust Devils]] Premium [[Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|45|notext}} and 30 [[Medal]]s, respectively.

==Passive Ability==
{{Armor Passive Info Panel|Desert Stormer}}

== Trivia ==
* The name of the armor set and the appearance of the helmet indicate that this armor set may be a reference to Sardaukar soldiers from the film [[wp:Dune (2021 film)|Dune (2021)]].

